tmp/
scratch/

# Never commit these. The app needs only a project URL and a publishable key,
# both of which are safe in a client. A service-role key, a Management API
# token, or the Postgres connection string must never end up in this repo.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
